{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything slows down except you \u2014 Experience Hyper-Acceleration Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neural Drive is an action rogue-lite where you harness acceleration powers to perform extraordinary feats and take on a powerful megacorporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/0c74f15d56813d8469ddf9e83f495257.poster.avif?t=1761810190\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/0c74f15d56813d8469ddf9e83f495257.webm?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/0c74f15d56813d8469ddf9e83f495257.mp4?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate your acceleration, and time itself slows \u2014 enemies, bullets, even missiles move in slow motion\u2026 except you. What will you do in this slowed world? Parry frozen bullets with your katana. Dodge sluggish enemy strikes and strike back \u2014 turn every action you imagined into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/97e3854904b15c8e676febe2ae1b0b96.poster.avif?t=1761810190\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/97e3854904b15c8e676febe2ae1b0b96.webm?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/97e3854904b15c8e676febe2ae1b0b96.mp4?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the corporation won\u2019t go down easily. The more you threaten them, the stronger their forces become, sending massive robots and elite enemies to stop you. Clear stages, collect rewards to enhance your abilities, and reclaim your freedom as the pressure intensifies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/fa89870108bea8c1142faf265cdaeb38.poster.avif?t=1761810190\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/fa89870108bea8c1142faf265cdaeb38.webm?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/fa89870108bea8c1142faf265cdaeb38.mp4?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acceleration-Based Combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend time to your will. Deflect projectiles, evade enemy attacks, and strike back against waves of enemies with precision and speed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Weapons with Unique Skills </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield close-range katanas, mid-range rifles, and long-range sniper rifles, each with specialized skills. Strategically choose which weapon to enhance with the abilities you acquire during your run. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Stages and Bosses </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemies and powerful bosses to unlock new stages. As you progress, uncover the hidden truths lurking in this cyberpunk world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132040?t=1761810190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132040?t=1761810190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/73fdc68f5072ede6d873edd3072734de35f7c8e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761810190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/73fdc68f5072ede6d873edd3072734de35f7c8e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761810190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything slows down except you \u2014 Experience Hyper-Acceleration Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neural Drive is an action rogue-lite where you harness acceleration powers to perform extraordinary feats and take on a powerful megacorporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/0c74f15d56813d8469ddf9e83f495257.poster.avif?t=1761810190\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/0c74f15d56813d8469ddf9e83f495257.webm?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/0c74f15d56813d8469ddf9e83f495257.mp4?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate your acceleration, and time itself slows \u2014 enemies, bullets, even missiles move in slow motion\u2026 except you. What will you do in this slowed world? Parry frozen bullets with your katana. Dodge sluggish enemy strikes and strike back \u2014 turn every action you imagined into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/97e3854904b15c8e676febe2ae1b0b96.poster.avif?t=1761810190\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/97e3854904b15c8e676febe2ae1b0b96.webm?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/97e3854904b15c8e676febe2ae1b0b96.mp4?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the corporation won\u2019t go down easily. The more you threaten them, the stronger their forces become, sending massive robots and elite enemies to stop you. Clear stages, collect rewards to enhance your abilities, and reclaim your freedom as the pressure intensifies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/fa89870108bea8c1142faf265cdaeb38.poster.avif?t=1761810190\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/fa89870108bea8c1142faf265cdaeb38.webm?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/extras/fa89870108bea8c1142faf265cdaeb38.mp4?t=1761810190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acceleration-Based Combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend time to your will. Deflect projectiles, evade enemy attacks, and strike back against waves of enemies with precision and speed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Weapons with Unique Skills </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield close-range katanas, mid-range rifles, and long-range sniper rifles, each with specialized skills. Strategically choose which weapon to enhance with the abilities you acquire during your run. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Stages and Bosses </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemies and powerful bosses to unlock new stages. As you progress, uncover the hidden truths lurking in this cyberpunk world.</p></li></ul>","developers":["GameTreeStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132040/3dd7c137a66dc28463b1f03e3be54aaafc1b9960/header.jpg?t=1761810190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Neural Drive","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX-8350 or Intel i5-3570<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 HD 7970 or NVIDIA GeForce GTX 680 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen\u2122 5 2600 (Intel i7-4770)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 590 or NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["GameTreeStudio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q1 202